SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Hannah Jones
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Hannah is a stand up comedian based in Brooklyn\, New York. Aft
 er being homeschooled in a conservative\, religious co-op\, her irreverent 
 takes on sex\, dating\, and gender politics are as original as they are dee
 ply uncomfortable for her mother to hear. She is a regular Woman About The
  Internet\, and her videos on Tiktok and Instagram have been viewed over 40
  million times\, where she is consistently "shitting on the mother toilet"\
 , as they say. She has been featured on Netflix Is a Joke Radio and Don't T
 ell Secret Sets. Her comedy has been written about in Denverite and Westwor
 d\, and covered on Channel 7 News. She has been invited to open for Josh Go
 ndelman\, Atsuko Okatsuka\, Todd Barry\, and Kumail Nanjiani. She is also a
  regular at the Denver Comedy Works\, where she has hosted for juggernauts 
 including Ari Shaffir\, Dave Attell\, and Aziz Ansari.\n\nThere is a two-it
 em per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any foo
 d or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased i
 n the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManageme
 nt reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who t
 hey deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://come
 dyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room-hannah-jones/
